{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.232.20.114","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46ff1ff58e9531cadc3cb840ceff4436","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Calistawhite\" post=\"1894420\" timestamp=\"1430055391\"]\nHello,\n\nI am about to order a dress with Mermaidbridal and I would like to know if someone has already received a dress from them?\n\nThank you very much![\/quote]\nI ordered a dress from Mermaidbridal and was very happy with it. The quality was great and the customer service was great as well. The dress came extremely quickly. I wouldn&#039;t hesitate to recommend them.\n[quote name=\"Lilian84\" post=\"1893643\" timestamp=\"1429499514\"]\nHello,\n\nDoes anyone have any information or reviews about [url=\"http:\/\/www.weddingdressesmall.co.uk\/%C2%A0\"]http:\/\/www.weddingdressesmall.co.uk\/ [\/url]\n\nTried on a wedding dress and don&#039;t know what the make and model is, but found it on this website. \n\nAny info will be appreciated.[\/quote]\nFrom the looks of that site it appears to be a Chinese replica shop. Nothing wrong with that, but just know you&#039;re not getting the actual designer dress for a lower price, but instead a replica.\n\nI actually recently ordered a dress from JJ&#039;s house and I am so happy! It is beautiful and came super fast! I highly recommend them. Here&#039;s the link: [url=\"http:\/\/www.jjshouse.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.jjshouse.com\/[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1894535,"PostDate":1430122496,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418131687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c19a39c0312124414e453e9d257b3df0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I didn&#039;t even think about the fact that I might be looking at a \"knock-off\" dress. I just found a style I like on Etsy. I have no idea if the design is original or not (probably not, given that I&#039;ve found a few that are pretty much the same). Not sure if I will order one or not, but does anyone have experience with the following Etsy vendors?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/MillyCouture&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/MillyCouture&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/LaceMarry&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/LaceMarry&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/RoseHauteCouture&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/RoseHauteCouture&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/YoursTailor&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/YoursTailor&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They all have a 4.5 - 5.0 rating, although some have more reviews than others. Would appreciate any input if anyone has dealt with any of these vendors before. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894796,"PostDate":1430260953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I didn't even think about the fact that I might be looking at a \"knock-off\" dress. I just found a style I like on Etsy. I have no idea if the design is original or not (probably not, given that I've found a few that are pretty much the same). Not sure if I will order one or not, but does anyone have experience with the following Etsy vendors?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/MillyCouture' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...op\/MillyCouture<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/LaceMarry' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/LaceMarry<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/RoseHauteCouture' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...oseHauteCouture<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/ca\/shop\/YoursTailor' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...hop\/YoursTailor<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They all have a 4.5 - 5.0 rating, although some have more reviews than others. Would appreciate any input if anyone has dealt with any of these vendors before. Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417431445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.129.101.77","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d84e7292cc002e25bf9962a13c490ef1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey All,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am looking for dresses and found one I love:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is a Sophia Tolli dress (the Prinia style) but way out of my budget.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What is the process to get another overseas designer at a cheaper price?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any suggestions?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":32759,"Name":"Prinia.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283732-0-87076300-1435500315.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-283732-0-87076300-1435500315_thumb.jpg","Width":306,"Height":342}],"Id":1899451,"PostDate":1435482318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey All,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am looking for dresses and found one I love:<\/p>\n<p>It is a Sophia Tolli dress (the Prinia style) but way out of my budget.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What is the process to get another overseas designer at a cheaper price?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any suggestions?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pjsantam@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.129.101.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435481923,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"psantam2","Id":283732,"Name":"psantam2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.56.86.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61075d6f23ba952d46da8f88b2ffe538","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"psantam2\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hi not sure where you are located, but I just bought my Sophia Tolli dress in a clearance sale at a store in Canada that was closing down. I got my dress for $950 and its regular $2100. Might be worth calling stores and asking if they have the dress and see if they have sales going on. Right now is a good time to look because most people get married in the summer so they will already have their dresses for this season.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899844,"PostDate":1436174747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283732\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283732-psantam2\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">psantam2<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Hi not sure where you are located, but I just bought my Sophia Tolli dress in a clearance sale at a store in Canada that was closing down. I got my dress for $950 and its regular $2100. Might be worth calling stores and asking if they have the dress and see if they have sales going on. Right now is a good time to look because most people get married in the summer so they will already have their dresses for this season.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432083304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.4.83.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1436344584,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"098b519268ff1e825eb7912be45b4149","RawContent":"Hi, i order my dress from dresillyme a month ago. It came this morning and i&#039;m pretty happy with the result. This is the pictures from the web, dress design originally from Essense of Australia. \n\n\nAnd this is my dress. Love it so much :) \n\nI will wear this dress for my prewedding photoshoot \n\n\n\nThe dress on me.\n\n\n\n\n\nIt&#039;s a little big in the chest area so i have to altered it, but the length is fine. The dress material is organza satin, not so high quality, but it&#039;s good for 149$ price haha\n\n(include shipping from China to Indonesia) \n\n\nDress came in 4days after they emailed me that they have ship the dress","Attachments":[],"Id":1899987,"PostDate":1436344504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, i order my dress from dresillyme a month ago. It came this morning and i'm pretty happy with the result. This is the pictures from the web, dress design originally from Essense of Australia. <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899987]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-40053300-1436362017.jpg\" title=\"4b01a4ee-a995-4cdd-bbc0-5835b16f70e2-550-768.jpg -  33.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-40053300-1436362017.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"4b01a4ee-a995-4cdd-bbc0-5835b16f70e2-550-768.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899987]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-97150400-1436362033.jpg\" title=\"62455049-7e59-4112-af06-1d3c93d408cd-550-768.jpg -  34.16KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-97150400-1436362033.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"62455049-7e59-4112-af06-1d3c93d408cd-550-768.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nAnd this is my dress. Love it so much <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br>\nI will wear this dress for my prewedding photoshoot <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899987]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-75509100-1436362187.jpg\" title=\"IMG_20150708_110944.JPG -  88.41KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-75509100-1436362187.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_20150708_110944.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899987]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-01171000-1436362215.jpg\" title=\"IMG_20150708_110743.JPG -  88.84KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-01171000-1436362215.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_20150708_110743.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899987]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-39149400-1436362247.jpg\" title=\"IMG_20150708_110920.JPG -  94.41KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-39149400-1436362247.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_20150708_110920.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nThe dress on me.<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1899987]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-90459300-1436362230.jpg\" title=\"IMG_20150708_114406.jpg -  164.42KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-283866-0-90459300-1436362230.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_20150708_114406.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nIt's a little big in the chest area so i have to altered it, but the length is fine. The dress material is organza satin, not so high quality, but it's good for 149$ price haha<br>\n(include shipping from China to Indonesia) <br><br>\nDress came in 4days after they emailed me that they have ship the dress\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vknee_apples@yahoo.co.id","IpAddress":"124.195.112.113","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436315542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Fenny","Id":283866,"Name":"Fenny","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.186.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9003d36cbcf1b0a74ab053041fe09344","RawContent":"Wow that dress is lovely and looks so much like the original! It is such a great price and looks fab on you xx\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1900075,"PostDate":1436401507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow that dress is lovely and looks so much like the original! It is such a great price and looks fab on you xx<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421803539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.4.119.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e10bda9039d3c9158dab939fbb41278","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ChelseaCat802\" post=\"1802104\" timestamp=\"1379948547\"]\n\nQuote:\nOriginally Posted by [b]SuffolkBride[\/b] [img]http:\/\/\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif[\/img]\n\n\nIt came it came it came!! :D I&#039;m overwhelmed by how lovely it is! I don&#039;t have any pics of it on me yet (and won&#039;t for a few days), and have hardly had a chance to look at it properly but from the light speed try on I did the workmanship is awesome and design is beautiful!\n\nFor anyone who doesn&#039;t want to scroll back through the thread, my dress is a modified version of Kitty Chen Ruby ordered from DressilyMe. Here is the DM link [url=\"http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-stunning-satin-tulle-a-line-bateau-neckline-natural-waistline-wedding-dress-38078.html%C2%A0\"]http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-stunning-satin-tulle-a-line-bateau-neckline-natural-waistline-wedding-dress-38078.html [\/url]I asked for a sweetheart neckline, laceup back, detachable straps, detachable belt and a longer train. \n\nHere are a couple of pics of details until I can get some proper pics :\n\nThis is the belt and detachable straps. The belt looks nothing like the one in the photo but I like it anyway! I like the way they made the satin a slightly more champagney colour so that it stands out better.\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221540\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n\n\nA close up of the lace on the detachable straps. [url=\"http:\/\/www.weddinginspirasi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/06\/aire-barcelona-2013-rafaela-beaded-lace-fit-flare-wedding-dress.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.weddinginspirasi.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2012\/06\/aire-barcelona-2013-rafaela-beaded-lace-fit-flare-wedding-dress.jpg[\/url]these are the ones I asked for - I&#039;m very happy with their interpretation! \n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221541\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n\nOne of the appliques on the tulle skirt. Gorgeous :) Some of the appliques aren&#039;t sew down as firmly as I would like, so might have to check a few.\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221542\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n\n\nThe lace on the bodice. No beading, despite the listing saying there is beaded lace appliques, but thats fine because the original doesn&#039;t have beads and I was worried they would add huge sequins or something!\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/221543\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\nI haven&#039;t added the corset strap yet :)\n\nOverall I&#039;m really impressed so far! I tried it on very briefly and its super-tight on the thighs so will have to get it adjusted (despite a seamstress measuring me), but its still a bargain :)\nLooks absolutely beautiful! Can&#039;t wait to see pictures of it on you! Congrats!\n[\/quote]wow.................it looks really really great. The details is clearly and looks gorgeous!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1900621,"PostDate":1437085553,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisa03862@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.200.209.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436144784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nichole0909","Id":283822,"Name":"Nichole0909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.19.134.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ac603c082eaeb98d5852cb00b3a6571","RawContent":"Wow can&#039;t wait to see more photos! \n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1900637,"PostDate":1437110541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow can't wait to see more photos! <br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1421803539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":