> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a69a4b9d7cd4f5c609af1a15214d05b3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1862557\" timestamp=\"1406475349\"]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28803\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1406475243.067287.jpg[\/url]\n\nHere is my ring and my wedding band together.\n\nThat&#039;s my original diamond but my second mount. The original one was so unique I couldn&#039;t find a wedding band and the custom route made me nervous.\n\nLOVE this one!! Hate to be honest but it&#039;s more me :)\n\n\n\n\nAll you ladies have beautiful rings![\/quote]Found it! I love your rings. They&#039;re so simple and elegant. Here are mine;\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1867600,"PostDate":1408409912,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 27 July 2014 - 10:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28803' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1406475243.067287.jpg<\/a><br><br>\nHere is my ring and my wedding band together.<br><br>\nThat's my original diamond but my second mount. The original one was so unique I couldn't find a wedding band and the custom route made me nervous.<br><br>\nLOVE this one!! Hate to be honest but it's more me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br><br><br>\nAll you ladies have beautiful rings!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nFound it! I love your rings. They're so simple and elegant. Here are mine;<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1867600]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-265511-14084279032.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1408428506.116557.jpg -  228.46KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-265511-14084279032.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1408428506.116557.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1408436851,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8d713ad35e372e6c936a32d49ecb165","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1867600\" timestamp=\"1408427912\"]\nFound it! I love your rings. They&#039;re so simple and elegant. Here are mine;[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=29132\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1408428506.116557.jpg[\/url]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Ohhhh I love yours too!!! Love all the diamonds and that you found a matching band! I can&#039;t believe that only cost $600... did you forget a number? hehe\n\nMy ring isn&#039;t necessarily what I had thought I&#039;d choose but when I saw it I was like &#039;love it!&#039; And when I got it made in platinum it was just so much more beautiful than the fake stock ones. And I just realized my picture doesn&#039;t really\nShow off the detail in the band.\nMy fiance&#039;s ring is a rope too. Here is his. He&#039;s pretty proud Of it. Hahah\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1867620,"PostDate":1408435460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 19 August 2014 - 12:58 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<p>Found it! I love your rings. They're so simple and elegant. Here are mine;<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=29132' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1408428506.116557.jpg<\/a><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Ohhhh I love yours too!!! Love all the diamonds and that you found a matching band! I can't believe that only cost $600... did you forget a number? hehe<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My ring isn't necessarily what I had thought I'd choose but when I saw it I was like 'love it!' And when I got it made in platinum it was just so much more beautiful than the fake stock ones. And I just realized my picture doesn't really<br>\nShow off the detail in the band.<br>\nMy fiance's ring is a rope too. Here is his. He's pretty proud Of it. Hahah<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1867620]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-277873-140845345769.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1408453456.251259.jpg -  245.13KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2014\/post-277873-140845345769.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1408453456.251259.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.172.160.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"795d347957b4ac53e0cac9d9f823db37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] I guess for so many diamonds the price wasn&#039;t bad. When I chose the E-ring I really liked how it went with its band, they were shown as a set, and I just couldn&#039;t picture it with anything else. I had a lot of issues with it when I ordered it though because it didn&#039;t fit with the engagement ring quite right. I had to send both of them back and they had to make a new one but when both came back, my e-ring was too big. I really don&#039;t know why because they remade the wedding band. Anyway, I had to send it back to get resized but now they&#039;re both good.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I like your fiance&#039;s ring too! Mine hasn&#039;t bought his yet. He likes the really simple ones because he doesn&#039;t really like wearing rings. I don&#039;t even know if he will end up wearing it but I told him the smaller it is the better chances he has of getting used to it. I don&#039;t even feel mine anymore but I feel like something is missing when I don&#039;t have it :P.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I wish mine was platinum! but we didn&#039;t have enough money&amp;nbsp; :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867683,"PostDate":1408460823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> I guess for so many diamonds the price wasn't bad. When I chose the E-ring I really liked how it went with its band, they were shown as a set, and I just couldn't picture it with anything else. I had a lot of issues with it when I ordered it though because it didn't fit with the engagement ring quite right. I had to send both of them back and they had to make a new one but when both came back, my e-ring was too big. I really don't know why because they remade the wedding band. Anyway, I had to send it back to get resized but now they're both good.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I like your fiance's ring too! Mine hasn't bought his yet. He likes the really simple ones because he doesn't really like wearing rings. I don't even know if he will end up wearing it but I told him the smaller it is the better chances he has of getting used to it. I don't even feel mine anymore but I feel like something is missing when I don't have it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wish mine was platinum! but we didn't have enough money\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa9f0cf567d45ae0a5753fb29722f6e2","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1867683\" timestamp=\"1408478823\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] I guess for so many diamonds the price wasn&#039;t bad. When I chose the E-ring I really liked how it went with its band, they were shown as a set, and I just couldn&#039;t picture it with anything else. I had a lot of issues with it when I ordered it though because it didn&#039;t fit with the engagement ring quite right. I had to send both of them back and they had to make a new one but when both came back, my e-ring was too big. I really don&#039;t know why because they remade the wedding band. Anyway, I had to send it back to get resized but now they&#039;re both good. \n\nI like your fiance&#039;s ring too! Mine hasn&#039;t bought his yet. He likes the really simple ones because he doesn&#039;t really like wearing rings. I don&#039;t even know if he will end up wearing it but I told him the smaller it is the better chances he has of getting used to it. I don&#039;t even feel mine anymore but I feel like something is missing when I don&#039;t have it :P. \n\nI wish mine was platinum! but we didn&#039;t have enough money  :([\/quote]\nLOL....  you got diamonds, I got platinum! :P\n\nI had my original one made smaller, but this one I ordered in the same size and it feels bigger.\nThey said it was probably because there is a lot less band and a higher sitting diamond. Wish they would have said something, but with the band it feels good so I don&#039;t plan to re size it as the .5 size smaller has a hard time getting over my knuckle! Will have them sauttered (sp?) though.   \n\nAt the end of the day I think Spence is a great company, so friendly there and not pushy!\n\nMy fiance&#039;s is from Ben Moss but only could find that design at the Cross Iron location. It was $375 I think!\nHe wanted something noone else had and I think he delivered.","Attachments":[],"Id":1867687,"PostDate":1408461427,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 19 August 2014 - 03:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> I guess for so many diamonds the price wasn't bad. When I chose the E-ring I really liked how it went with its band, they were shown as a set, and I just couldn't picture it with anything else. I had a lot of issues with it when I ordered it though because it didn't fit with the engagement ring quite right. I had to send both of them back and they had to make a new one but when both came back, my e-ring was too big. I really don't know why because they remade the wedding band. Anyway, I had to send it back to get resized but now they're both good.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I like your fiance's ring too! Mine hasn't bought his yet. He likes the really simple ones because he doesn't really like wearing rings. I don't even know if he will end up wearing it but I told him the smaller it is the better chances he has of getting used to it. I don't even feel mine anymore but I feel like something is missing when I don't have it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I wish mine was platinum! but we didn't have enough money\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>LOL.... \u00a0you got diamonds, I got platinum! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had my original one made smaller, but this one I ordered in the same size and it feels bigger.<\/p>\n<p>They said it was probably because there is a lot less band and a higher sitting diamond. Wish they would have said something, but with the band it feels good so I don't plan to re size it as the .5 size smaller has a hard time getting over my knuckle! Will have them sauttered (sp?) though. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At the end of the day I think Spence is a great company, so friendly there and not pushy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance's is from Ben Moss but only could find that design at the Cross Iron location. It was $375 I think!<\/p>\n<p>He wanted something noone else had and I think he delivered.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.172.160.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8361caf0d6e4016cd3833ca09e033926","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] haha yes, I guess you can have one or the other :p. I think your fiance&#039;s is very unique and I agree, spence is a good company. For my e-ring we didn&#039;t even shop around, well my fiance didn&#039;t shop around. We went to see rings so I could tell him what kinds of things I liked and before I knew it he had bought it haha. We had to negotiate a bit with the fixing of the band because they wanted to charge us but I told them it wasn&#039;t my fault they made it wrong.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nI&#039;m worried my ring won&#039;t get through my finger on the wedding day! bahah, with all the heat, sun and alcohol... I&#039;m going to have to dip my hand in ice before I head out haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867690,"PostDate":1408461775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> haha yes, I guess you can have one or the other <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. I think your fiance's is very unique and I agree, spence is a good company. For my e-ring we didn't even shop around, well my fiance didn't shop around. We went to see rings so I could tell him what kinds of things I liked and before I knew it he had bought it haha. We had to negotiate a bit with the fixing of the band because they wanted to charge us but I told them it wasn't my fault they made it wrong.\u00a0<br><br>\nI'm worried my ring won't get through my finger on the wedding day! bahah, with all the heat, sun and alcohol... I'm going to have to dip my hand in ice before I head out haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cef22578dd894fc70f3f5d8df166903","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1867690\" timestamp=\"1408479775\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] haha yes, I guess you can have one or the other :P. I think your fiance&#039;s is very unique and I agree, spence is a good company. For my e-ring we didn&#039;t even shop around, well my fiance didn&#039;t shop around. We went to see rings so I could tell him what kinds of things I liked and before I knew it he had bought it haha. We had to negotiate a bit with the fixing of the band because they wanted to charge us but I told them it wasn&#039;t my fault they made it wrong. \n\nI&#039;m worried my ring won&#039;t get through my finger on the wedding day! bahah, with all the heat, sun and alcohol... I&#039;m going to have to dip my hand in ice before I head out haha.[\/quote]\nGood for you!  I think sizing is pricey, no?\nI am actually scared to wear my ring around the resort during our trip, but also scared to leave it in the safe!  If I wasn&#039;t getting married I would just leave it at home. I never bring valuables with me!  Well except my ipad lol.\n\nI gave my little wish list, even though I had NO idea whatsoever he was going to propose. I was shocked.\nMy list - princess cut, white gold, and no clusters.\n\nTo be honest my first ring was 19k. When I changed it in you either get a straight exchange or you pay out. You don&#039;t get a refund. Since my ring was a lot less gold I would have lost $300 if I went with 19k and that made my fiance sick, so we got the platinum as a straight exchange.","Attachments":[],"Id":1867691,"PostDate":1408462155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 19 August 2014 - 03:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> haha yes, I guess you can have one or the other <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>. I think your fiance's is very unique and I agree, spence is a good company. For my e-ring we didn't even shop around, well my fiance didn't shop around. We went to see rings so I could tell him what kinds of things I liked and before I knew it he had bought it haha. We had to negotiate a bit with the fixing of the band because they wanted to charge us but I told them it wasn't my fault they made it wrong.\u00a0<br><br>\nI'm worried my ring won't get through my finger on the wedding day! bahah, with all the heat, sun and alcohol... I'm going to have to dip my hand in ice before I head out haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good for you! \u00a0I think sizing is pricey, no?<\/p>\n<p>I am actually scared to wear my ring around the resort during our trip, but also scared to leave it in the safe! \u00a0If I wasn't getting married I would just leave it at home. I never bring valuables with me! \u00a0Well except my ipad lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I gave my little wish list, even though I had NO idea whatsoever he was going to propose. I was shocked.<\/p>\n<p>My list - princess cut, white gold, and no clusters.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To be honest my first ring was 19k. When I changed it in you either get a straight exchange or you pay out. You don't get a refund. Since my ring was a lot less gold I would have lost $300 if I went with 19k and that made my fiance sick, so we got the platinum as a straight exchange.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.218.252.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1222c257f278539e1573bfe65e64e706","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ec0.pinimg.com\/736x\/4c\/a7\/39\/4ca739e8a266140d846600b7de82c471.jpg\" alt=\"4ca739e8a266140d846600b7de82c471.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/img1.etsystatic.com\/016\/0\/6192894\/il_570xN.432099583_2qk8.jpg\" alt=\"il_570xN.432099583_2qk8.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876458,"PostDate":1413903654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ec0.pinimg.com\/736x\/4c\/a7\/39\/4ca739e8a266140d846600b7de82c471.jpg\" alt=\"4ca739e8a266140d846600b7de82c471.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/img1.etsystatic.com\/016\/0\/6192894\/il_570xN.432099583_2qk8.jpg\" alt=\"il_570xN.432099583_2qk8.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411390087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bc1af37554a2fa427a84b614ce1f291","RawContent":"Here is mine!","Attachments":[{"Id":29838,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2014\/post-280304-0-11468100-1413977451.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2014\/post-280304-0-11468100-1413977451_thumb.jpg","Width":64