Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b4c884166e3baca23ad439ba256ab13","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; OK the FI is not at home so I was able to actually try it on properly and look in the mirror. :)&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s hard to try it on without another set of hands though but I managed to zip up and everything! :) Here are 2 pictures. It fits perfectly and with my shoes too! Should I get a beaded sash for the waist? Does it look kind of plain? As for jewelry I was thinking of going for a simple pearl necklace and pearl earrings, just because the dress is already \"pretty fun\" with the frills. :) My wedding is 9 months away and I can&#039;t wait for my FI to see it. :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349450529727_8463\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"165774\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165774\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349450529727_6207\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"165773\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165773\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1670981,"PostDate":1349433637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> OK the FI is not at home so I was able to actually try it on properly and look in the mirror. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 It's hard to try it on without another set of hands though but I managed to zip up and everything! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Here are 2 pictures. It fits perfectly and with my shoes too! Should I get a beaded sash for the waist? Does it look kind of plain? As for jewelry I was thinking of going for a simple pearl necklace and pearl earrings, just because the dress is already \"pretty fun\" with the frills. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> My wedding is 9 months away and I can't wait for my FI to see it. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349450529727_8463\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165774\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165774\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_5_1_1_1349450529727_6207\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"165773\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165773\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessicaandcurtis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345537503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259435.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"somethingblue77","Id":259435,"Name":"somethingblue77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8fcb1ccaa3a60e9f5b9695751e3e6b0","RawContent":"The sash is a matter of preference, but I think this is the perfect dress to add one! There&#039;s a great selection out there via web. You look gorgeous. Congrats , so glad you got what you wanted at a good price, it looks great!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1671040,"PostDate":1349442060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The sash is a matter of preference, but I think this is the perfect dress to add one! There's a great selection out there via web. You look gorgeous. Congrats , so glad you got what you wanted at a good price, it looks great!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Enjoythepartykm@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.13.213.79","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343375580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258455.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tulumbride2013","Id":258455,"Name":"Tulumbride2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d77dbc3eeeb01696f6730a97c827f2d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think it looks great! Do you mind telling us how much you paid? Was Did you choose a style off there website or have it custom made?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1671050,"PostDate":1349443050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think it looks great! Do you mind telling us how much you paid? Was Did you choose a style off there website or have it custom made?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristiethorn@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1330524203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252104.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KristieT","Id":252104,"Name":"KristieT","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be14a087b8d1244487b7ec584135f86c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KristieT[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I think it looks great! Do you mind telling us how much you paid? Was Did you choose a style off there website or have it custom made?[\/quote] \n Hi! I paid $230 for it plus $30 for shipping and $30 for duties. This is a replica of a dress from David&#039;s Bridal which was a replica from Vera Wang. So I sent the link to Dressilyme and they customized it to my size so I don&#039;t have to spend money on alterations too. (which I heard can be quite expensive).","Attachments":[],"Id":1706808,"PostDate":1358343744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KristieT<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I think it looks great! Do you mind telling us how much you paid? Was Did you choose a style off there website or have it custom made?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hi! I paid $230 for it plus $30 for shipping and $30 for duties. This is a replica of a dress from David's Bridal which was a replica from Vera Wang. So I sent the link to Dressilyme and they customized it to my size so I don't have to spend money on alterations too. (which I heard can be quite expensive).<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessicaandcurtis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345537503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259435.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"somethingblue77","Id":259435,"Name":"somethingblue77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46663bb79d538fda8272a0374bf8e54e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I stumbled on Dressilyme somehow a couple of months ago...and it&#039;s been on my mind ever since.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I keep debating whether or not I want to purchase a dress from them or try my luck with trying to find on in a non-bridal store.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How long did it take to have your dress custom made? How is their customer service? Since you had it custom tailored to you, are you worried about the way it will fit for the wedding?&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366875658915_1740\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/feedback.gif\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.231;\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1750573,"PostDate":1366857984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I stumbled on Dressilyme somehow a couple of months ago...and it's been on my mind ever since.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I keep debating whether or not I want to purchase a dress from them or try my luck with trying to find on in a non-bridal store.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How long did it take to have your dress custom made? How is their customer service? Since you had it custom tailored to you, are you worried about the way it will fit for the wedding?\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1366875658915_1740\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/feedback.gif\" style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.231;\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Bride2be4414@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.58.36.78","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1366295632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268722.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CAKnight","Id":268722,"Name":"CAKnight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.200.209.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2964788856975bb17f836852e43e3dcd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"somethingblue77\" post=\"1657884\" timestamp=\"1346252605\"]\nHi brides! I am just wondering if you have ordered your dresses from this website and what is the result? Did you like it, did it fit, did it met your expectations?\n\nI am just about to order mine. :)[\/quote]I have ordered from Dressilyme twice.  I had good experiences and I&#039;m very satisfied!  And the second time I got my wedding dress (WWD11593).  I bought an Ivory with Light Champagne color.  The details on the bodice is exquisite and the back design is unique. The price is wonderful.  I love it ! Very happy with the purchase.\n[quote name=\"somethingblue77\" post=\"1670981\" timestamp=\"1349451637\"]\nOK the FI is not at home so I was able to actually try it on properly and look in the mirror. :)  It&#039;s hard to try it on without another set of hands though but I managed to zip up and everything! :) Here are 2 pictures. It fits perfectly and with my shoes too! Should I get a beaded sash for the waist? Does it look kind of plain? As for jewelry I was thinking of going for a simple pearl necklace and pearl earrings, just because the dress is already \"pretty fun\" with the frills. :) My wedding is 9 months away and I can&#039;t wait for my FI to see it. :)\n\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165774\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165773\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote]Woooow.....you look amazing on the dress!!!! And the dress looks well made and gorgeous!","Attachments":[],"Id":1899829,"PostDate":1436145279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>somethingblue77, on 29 August 2012 - 10:03 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi brides! I am just wondering if you have ordered your dresses from this website and what is the result? Did you like it, did it fit, did it met your expectations?<br><br>\nI am just about to order mine. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I have ordered from Dressilyme twice. \u00a0I had good experiences and I'm very satisfied! \u00a0And the second time I got my wedding dress (WWD11593). \u00a0I bought an Ivory with Light Champagne color. \u00a0The details on the bodice is exquisite and the back design is unique. The price is wonderful. \u00a0I love it ! Very happy with the purchase.<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>somethingblue77, on 05 October 2012 - 10:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>OK the FI is not at home so I was able to actually try it on properly and look in the mirror. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 It's hard to try it on without another set of hands though but I managed to zip up and everything! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Here are 2 pictures. It fits perfectly and with my shoes too! Should I get a beaded sash for the waist? Does it look kind of plain? As for jewelry I was thinking of going for a simple pearl necklace and pearl earrings, just because the dress is already \"pretty fun\" with the frills. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> My wedding is 9 months away and I can't wait for my FI to see it. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165774\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165773\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Woooow.....you look amazing on the dress!!!! And the dress looks well made and gorgeous!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisa03862@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.200.209.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436144784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nichole0909","Id":283822,"Name":"Nichole0909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.200.199.195","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1436213653,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c584d57b8c990c4f915d6fdf8a10d94","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Nichole0909\" post=\"1899829\" timestamp=\"1436163279\"][\/quote][quote name=\"somethingblue77\" post=\"1670981\" timestamp=\"1349451637\"]\nOK the FI is not at home so I was able to actually try it on properly and look in the mirror. :)  It&#039;s hard to try it on without another set of hands though but I managed to zip up and everything! :) Here are 2 pictures. It fits perfectly and with my shoes too! Should I get a beaded sash for the waist? Does it look kind of plain? As for jewelry I was thinking of going for a simple pearl necklace and pearl earrings, just because the dress is already \"pretty fun\" with the frills. :) My wedding is 9 months away and I can&#039;t wait for my FI to see it. :)\n\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165774\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165773\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote][color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Woooow.....you look amazing on the dress!!!! And the dress looks well made and gorgeous![\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1899883,"PostDate":1436213872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Nichole0909, on 06 July 2015 - 01:14 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>somethingblue77, on 05 October 2012 - 10:40 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>OK the FI is not at home so I was able to actually try it on properly and look in the mirror. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 It's hard to try it on without another set of hands though but I managed to zip up and everything! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Here are 2 pictures. It fits perfectly and with my shoes too! Should I get a beaded sash for the waist? Does it look kind of plain? As for jewelry I was thinking of going for a simple pearl necklace and pearl earrings, just because the dress is already \"pretty fun\" with the frills. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> My wedding is 9 months away and I can't wait for my FI to see it. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165774\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/165773\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Woooow.....you look amazing on the dress!!!! And the dress looks well made and gorgeous!<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisa03862@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.200.209.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436144784,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nichole0909","Id":283822,"Name":"Nichole0909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.201.246.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"199ff7b194bdbc13b3d498ab795b1904","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;My brother&#039;s wedding was planned in July and I needed &amp;nbsp;lots of dresses for the wedding. So I ordered one dress as a sample from \u2018dressilyme\u2019 on may 5th and received it on the 27th May. Excellent and reliable customer service. It was packed safely and shipped with care. Not much creases for an international shipment. The customer service executive was very helpful. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;It is good quality and the service is great. I want to thank everybody involved in making my dress. You people are doing a great job! I am sure I will be ordering more dress from your store. Thanks and love.\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905039,"PostDate":1442619769,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">My brother's wedding was planned in July and I needed \u00a0lots of dresses for the wedding. So I ordered one dress as a sample from \u2018dressilyme\u2019 on may 5th and received it on the 27th May. Excellent and reliable customer service. It was packed safely and shipped with care. Not much creases for an international shipment. The customer service executive was very helpful. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">It is good quality and the service is great. I want to thank everybody involved in making my dress. You people are doing a great job! I am sure I will be ordering more dress from your store. Thanks and love.\"<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ameen.azher@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.201.246.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442619427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Shaheen","Id":284864,"Name":"Shaheen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.201.254.198","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1442789190,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83138c32ff4fa4a288e818e1c1684cf7","RawContent":"@Shaheen\n[quote name=\"Shaheen\" post=\"1905039\" timestamp=\"1442637769\"][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1905116,"PostDate":1442788879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Shaheen<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Shaheen, on 18 September 2015 - 11:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ameen.azher@gmail.com","IpAddress":"117.201.246.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442619427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Shaheen","Id":284864,"Name":"Shaheen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"223.255.230.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69230,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9de9aece89373331378e26170606c2f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;o ya... what kind of it??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i usually buy from wallao...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i&#039;m not too sure with shopping online, but with wallao i trust.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905128,"PostDate":1442817109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>o ya... what kind of it??<\/p>\n<p>i usually buy from wallao...\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>i'm not too sure with shopping online, but with wallao i trust.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430646822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
