Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":308,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1907933,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285465,"Name":"bean527","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285465.jpg?_r=1449401492","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1448775135,"LastPoster":{"Id":285382,"Name":"MarMig","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1907933,"PostDate":1448775135,"PostContent":"I'm American and my fiance is Egyptian, and we'll be getting married in Egypt next August. We'll...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abyrne527@gmail.com","IpAddress":"149.154.216.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448774228,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285465.jpg?_r=1449401492","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"bean527","Id":285465,"Name":"bean527","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.154.216.197","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b5270f16994819e6ff3f27095753b69","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m American and my fiance is Egyptian, and we&#039;ll be getting married in Egypt next August. We&#039;ll also be living there after the wedding. I have also already lived there for a while, so it&#039;s only really a destination wedding for my family\/friends, not his. With that being said, Egypt is very far and my family isn&#039;t the travelling type (almost nobody has a passport), so I don&#039;t expect a lot of them to come. I do however have to invite everyone, and I have a big family; my dad has 12 siblings and I am close to all of my aunts\/uncles\/cousins. My question is, how do I go about invitations since I know many people won&#039;t be able to make it? I was thinking of inviting more friends under the assumption that most of my family won&#039;t come, but that seems risky because there is always that small chance that people will take this as their once in a lifetime opportunity to travel to Egypt, and all show up. My fiance will have a lot of family\/friends there since they are almost all already in Egypt, so I also don&#039;t want to run the risk of having hardly anyone from my side if I invite only the number of guests that my budget allows for.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907933,"PostDate":1448775135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm American and my fiance is Egyptian, and we'll be getting married in Egypt next August. We'll also be living there after the wedding. I have also already lived there for a while, so it's only really a destination wedding for my family\/friends, not his. With that being said, Egypt is very far and my family isn't the travelling type (almost nobody has a passport), so I don't expect a lot of them to come. I do however have to invite everyone, and I have a big family; my dad has 12 siblings and I am close to all of my aunts\/uncles\/cousins. My question is, how do I go about invitations since I know many people won't be able to make it? I was thinking of inviting more friends under the assumption that most of my family won't come, but that seems risky because there is always that small chance that people will take this as their once in a lifetime opportunity to travel to Egypt, and all show up. My fiance will have a lot of family\/friends there since they are almost all already in Egypt, so I also don't want to run the risk of having hardly anyone from my side if I invite only the number of guests that my budget allows for.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abyrne527@gmail.com","IpAddress":"149.154.216.197","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1448774228,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285465.jpg?_r=1449401492","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"bean527","Id":285465,"Name":"bean527","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc888089d211c55a00227fed49c87a32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Have you considered sending a \"save the date\" first to see if you get any responses back or hints from people that might be considering attending? It isn&#039;t foolproof but might give you an idea if people are thinking about it. Egypt is a really long way so it might be a bit more difficult to get people to travel. Destination weddings usually factor about 50% of invitees that will attend but since yours is even further you might figure a smaller number. You could also try asking people in advance if it&#039;s something they might be considering. Otherwise I would just send invitations as you normally would and see what happens.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck! That&#039;s a very interesting part of the world to be planning a wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908000,"PostDate":1448980050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have you considered sending a \"save the date\" first to see if you get any responses back or hints from people that might be considering attending? It isn't foolproof but might give you an idea if people are thinking about it. Egypt is a really long way so it might be a bit more difficult to get people to travel. Destination weddings usually factor about 50% of invitees that will attend but since yours is even further you might figure a smaller number. You could also try asking people in advance if it's something they might be considering. Otherwise I would just send invitations as you normally would and see what happens.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck! That's a very interesting part of the world to be planning a wedding!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.58.155.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79766,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a28c99afaeb61c327b9c532e3843f91","RawContent":"I would send save the dates just to check who would go or not.","Attachments":[],"Id":1908094,"PostDate":1449168272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would send save the dates just to check who would go or not. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_perello@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"96.57.145.250","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447923462,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MarMig","Id":285382,"Name":"MarMig","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79766","Title":"How Many Invitations To Send","LastPostDate":1449168272},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
